  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 1.2,
   "dur": 5.29,
   "speech": "上一集，多层感知机和时间卷积，都在看固定邻域。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 7.04,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "speech": "感知机看整个窗口，卷积看核覆盖的那一段。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 12.1,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "speech": "但两者都写着同一个假设：谁看谁，由结构定死。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 17.89,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "这一集换一种做法：让每个位置自己决定看哪里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 23.18,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "这就是这一集的主角，注意力。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 26.99,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "书里只用了一个式子，式二点六五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 31.18,
   "dur": 5.53,
   "speech": "q 乘 k 的转置，除以根号 d k，过 softmax，再乘 v。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 37.26,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "一行式子，其实干着三件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 41.16,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "第一件，归一化：每一行的权重加起来必须是一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 46.69,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "第二件，选择：分数高的位置，权重就大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 51.67,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "第三件，可解释：整张权重矩阵能画出来看。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 57.01,
   "dur": 5.65,
   "speech": "前两件能用数值钉死，第三件才是这一集的演示核心。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 63.22,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "先说四个数，看到结尾你都能对上。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 67.64,
   "dur": 6.13,
   "speech": "第一个，三个元素的 softmax：零点零九、零点二四、零点六七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 74.33,
   "dur": 5.7,
   "speech": "第二个，权重矩阵每行之和的偏差，一点一一乘十的负十六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 80.58,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speech": "第三个，复制任务三百步后，和单位阵的平均偏差，零点零零一五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 87.29,
   "dur": 5.99,
   "speech": "第四个，没有位置编码时把输入打乱，输出跟着打乱，差值是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 93.83,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "前三个数说它算得对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 97.22,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "第四个数说它缺了什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 100.64,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "这四个数，就是这一集的骨架。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 104.66,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "先说为什么这件事容易看错。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 111.27,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "第一个会骗人的数字，是损失。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 115.1,
   "dur": 6.45,
   "speech": "复制任务训练三百步，损失从零点三零八八降到零点零零零四六七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 122.09,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "损失曲线很漂亮，看起来收敛得很干净。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 126.81,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "但位置编码写错的时候，损失照样能降。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 131.6,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "因为模型可以学另一个捷径：把内容本身当索引。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 136.7,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "真正该看的是注意力矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 140.24,
   "dur": 5.05,
   "speech": "它是不是变成了单位阵：第 t 行只在第 t 列上有一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 145.84,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "speech": "我们第一次写，损失卡在零点零三二五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 150.41,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "矩阵的对角线，压不干净。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 154.07,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "和单位阵的偏差，三点三一乘十的负二次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 159.17,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "原因不是训练不够，是位置码不够用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 163.41,
   "dur": 4.86,
   "speech": "八个维度的位置码，张不出十六个几乎正交的位置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 168.82,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "第二个会骗人的数字，是 softmax 本身。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 173.47,
   "dur": 5.08,
   "speech": "教科书上的写法，先算 e 的 z 次方，再除以总和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 179.09,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "z 等于一二三，没问题。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 182.59,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "把三个数一起加一千，指数就溢出了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 187.25,
   "dur": 4.31,
   "speech": "溢出之后是无穷比无穷，结果全是 NaN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 192.11,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "稳定写法只多做一步：每行先减去这一行的最大值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 197.65,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "减完再算，逐位一致，差值零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 201.81,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "这一步不是优化，是正确性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 205.47,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "第三个数，置换等变。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 208.79,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "不加位置编码，把输入的位置换个顺序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 213.39,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "注意力矩阵跟着换行换列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 217.1,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "输出跟着换位置，数值也跟着换。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 221.57,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "两次结果的差值，是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 225.14,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "也就是说，模型对顺序一无所知。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 229.45,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "三个数字放在一起，说明一件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 233.59,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "光看损失，看不出注意力学没学会。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 237.99,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "得把矩阵画出来，把偏差算出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 242.06,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "这就是这一集的验证方法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 248.42,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speech": "复制任务很简单。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 251.29,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "speech": "输入十六步，每一步八个随机数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 255.26,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "输出要求一模一样，把输入抄一遍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 259.5,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "唯一能用的信息，是每一步自己的值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 263.92,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "所以注意力矩阵必须接近单位阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 268.26,
   "dur": 4.36,
   "speech": "第 t 个输出，只能从第 t 个输入取值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 273.16,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "怎么让它学会抄写，而不是学别的？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 277.4,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "给每一步拼上十六维位置码。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 281.16,
   "dur": 4.62,
   "speech": "位置码用正弦余弦，不同位置几乎是正交的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 286.33,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "查询和键，都从这份拼接输入投影出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 291.07,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "同一位置的 q 和 k 内积最大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 294.92,
   "dur": 2.25,
   "speech": "不同位置的很小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 297.72,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "除以根号 d k，把分数的尺度压回正常范围。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 303.01,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "再过 softmax，最大的那个就接近一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 307.53,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "于是矩阵收敛到单位阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 311.12,
   "dur": 2.63,
   "speech": "输出就是输入本身。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 314.3,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "整个模型没有位置之外的信息，也没有偏置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 319.02,
   "dur": 4.84,
   "speech": "参数只有两个投影矩阵：十六乘二十四，各一个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 324.4,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "加起来七百六十八个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 327.61,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "手算一个最小的例子，两行两维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 331.77,
   "dur": 4.93,
   "speech": "让 q 和 k 都等于单位阵，v 等于十乘单位阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 337.26,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "分数是一除以根号二，零点七零七一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 342,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "对角线上 softmax 之后是零点六六九八。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 346.93,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "非对角线是零点三三零二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 350.73,
   "dur": 4.91,
   "speech": "输出第一行就是六点六九七六和三点三零二四。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 356.19,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "这就是测试里钉住的那组黄金值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 360.4,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "你可能问，位置码为什么要拼，而不是加。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 365,
   "dur": 2.34,
   "speech": "我们真试过相加。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 367.89,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "八维内容和八维位置码混在一起。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 372.01,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "十六个位置在八维空间里挤不开。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 376.2,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "改成拼接，输入变成二十四维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 380.34,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "对角压得下来了，损失降到零点零零零四六七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 385.68,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "这个改动，是这一集最贵的一课。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 389.67,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "也是自证清单里专门记下的一条。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 396.88,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "现在把式二点六五拆开。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 400.3,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "输入是一个矩阵 x，形状是 t 乘 d。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 405.09,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "三个投影：q 等于 x 乘 w q。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 409.64,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "k 等于 x 乘 w k。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 413.22,
   "dur": 5.41,
   "speech": "书里说，查询代表需求，键代表标识，值代表内容。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 419.19,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "我们的复制任务里，v 就直接取 x。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 423.66,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "这不是偷懒：抄写任务要输出的就是输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 428.64,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "speech": "分数矩阵是 q 乘 k 的转置，形状 t 乘 t。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 433.7,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "speech": "第 i 行第 j 列，表示第 i 个位置多想看第 j 个位置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 439.49,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "除以根号 d k，是因为内积随维度增长。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 444.3,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "不除，维度一大，softmax 就退化成 one hot。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 449.84,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "除完再按行做 softmax。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 453.64,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "每一行独立归一化，行和必须是一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 458.26,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "输出等于权重矩阵乘 v，形状还是 t 乘 d。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 463.55,
   "dur": 4.84,
   "speech": "因果掩码把上三角的分数设成负十的三十次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 468.94,
   "dur": 2.44,
   "speech": "为什么不用负无穷？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 471.93,
